Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||10-29-2001||06:45 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.kincardine.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kincardine.net/</A> <P>this is my town's website. If you knew how much they paid for this garbage, you'd be violently ill.. You should have seen the mockup I put together when I put my bid in to do this. (it was nice.. picture of a sunset, areas of the site made to look like street signs..) The people who run my town are a bunch of corrupt morons. (guess you have to live here to know why they're corrupt.. but anyone who looks at what they bought for a website can see they're morons.)<P>Feel free to let them know what a wonderful website they have.. maybe ask why they hired someone from out of town when there are several talented web developers in Kincardine..<P>p.s. if anyone thinks it's unprofessional to say this.. <B>just ignore this post.</B> I didn't lose the contract because of lack of talent, it was because the people in charge of this project were dumb and made stupid assumptions, and then the town merged with several others and the project got cancelled.. though I'm not sure how sunsets.com got the contract, they're some of the worst designers around here...<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||8
